# `.claude/*` (glob), NOT `.claude/` (directory): git cannot re-include a
# file whose PARENT DIRECTORY is excluded, so the directory form silently
# defeats every negation below it.
.claude/*
# Agent and skill definitions are NOT versioned here. They are operator
# configuration that lives at user scope (~/.claude/agents, ~/.claude/skills);
# the repo copies drifted from the originals actually loaded at runtime and
# were removed. Do not re-add un-ignore rules for them -- a project-scope copy
# shadows the user-scope definition and the divergence is invisible.
# Shared Claude config is REVIEWED CONFIG, not local state: hooks change
# agent behaviour repo-wide, and one that exists only in someone's home
# directory is an undocumented behaviour change no review ever saw.
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/settings.json
# ...but genuinely local/volatile state stays out.
.claude/hooks/state/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scratch/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.frob/
.serena/

